{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/bbcb5772ab6c9fb42c5e3c14f3c4aef8.poster.avif?t=1767877215\" width=780 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/bbcb5772ab6c9fb42c5e3c14f3c4aef8.webm?t=1767877215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/bbcb5772ab6c9fb42c5e3c14f3c4aef8.mp4?t=1767877215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEKTORI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sektori is an intense, fast paced twin-stick shooter infused with hard hitting techno music. Choose your upgrades carefully and create powerful builds to take on the relentless enemies and epic bosses on a constantly evolving battlefield. Sektori is a game that requires your complete focus, a game where the high-adrenaline visuals, music, and gameplay come together to transport you into another state of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, pure gameplay. Quick runs. Lots of challenge and replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A five world campaign mode with dynamically changing levels and tons of enemy variation - including epic evolving bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate ships and configurable upgrade decks to mold your run with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty modes suited for all players, including a &quot;Revolution&quot; campaign mode for maximal challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six alternate game modes, like Classic, Gates and Assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied selection of challenges and medals to reach for</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Sektori I wanted to create a shoot'em up where every run feels familiar, but is still completely unique. A game of skill, not memorization. The hand crafted attack waves, levels and even the bosses are combined, randomized and layered with the upgrade systems in a way that creates an interesting challenge for every run. The aesthetics of the game are very much inspired by techno music. Fast, detailed, colorful, saturated, intense, aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in, take on the challenge as it comes and have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/98bea3dc42319bc8fa58df2511ceed07.poster.avif?t=1767877215\" width=780 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/98bea3dc42319bc8fa58df2511ceed07.webm?t=1767877215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/98bea3dc42319bc8fa58df2511ceed07.mp4?t=1767877215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enlightenment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2105620/3d52768a5278eefa07f6ea06e189e8f758b4dab2.jpg"},{"name":"Curious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2105620/d06ea8beaf2b2bc098af5db0c7781af6db11ef10.jpg"},{"name":"Engaged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2105620/f83fcb396f60fc6ccf8745f860eb77b50aac9cc0.jpg"},{"name":"Focused","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati