tion of challenges and medals to reach for</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Sektori I wanted to create a shoot'em up where every run feels familiar, but is still completely unique. A game of skill, not memorization. The hand crafted attack waves, levels and even the bosses are combined, randomized and layered with the upgrade systems in a way that creates an interesting challenge for every run. The aesthetics of the game are very much inspired by techno music. Fast, detailed, colorful, saturated, intense, aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in, take on the challenge as it comes and have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/98bea3dc42319bc8fa58df2511ceed07.poster.avif?t=1767877215\" width=780 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/98bea3dc42319bc8fa58df2511ceed07.webm?t=1767877215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/98bea3dc42319bc8fa58df2511ceed07.mp4?t=1767877215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Kimmo Lahtinen"],"dlc":[3972030],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/header.jpg?t=1767877215","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Kimmo Factor Oy","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas